<diagram program="umletino" version="15.1"><zoom_level>3</zoom_level><element><id>UMLSequenceAllInOne</id><coordinates><x>1053</x><y>10</y><w>930</w><h>489</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>title=SD03 — Budget and Plan Setup, Tracking and Alerts (UC03, F03)
obj=User~User ACTOR
obj=DashboardView~DV
obj=WealthSeiFacade~F
obj=PlanService~PLS
obj=PlanRepository~PLR
obj=BudgetService~BS
obj=BudgetRepository~BR
obj=TransactionRepository~TR
obj=AlertMonitor~AM
obj=AlertListener~L

DV: DashboardView and CliApp registered earlier via addAlertListener(), which calls AlertMonitor.attach()
DV: Part A - save the plan (income, balance, bills, planned expenses)
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;DV: enter the plan, click Save Plan
DV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: savePlan(plan)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;PLS: savePlan(plan)
PLS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PLS +1: validate(plan)
combinedFragment=alt~cf1 User PLR; User:             [negative amount, missing pay date, unknown frequency or future balance date]
PLS.&gt;F: throw ValidationException
F.&gt;DV: error message
DV.&gt;User: show the validation error
..=cf1; User: [plan valid]
PLS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PLR: save(plan)
PLS.&gt;F: FinancialPlan
F.&gt;DV: FinancialPlan
DV.&gt;User: plan saved, forecasts use it from now on
--=cf1
DV: Part B - set budget limits and raise alerts
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;DV: edit category limits, click Save
DV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: setBudget(month, limits)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS: setBudget(month, limits)
BS-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS +1: validate(limits)
combinedFragment=alt~cf2 User L; User:  [a limit is negative or invalid]
BS.&gt;F: throw InvalidBudgetException
F.&gt;DV: error message
DV.&gt;User: show validation error
..=cf2; User: [limits valid]
BS-&gt;&gt;&gt;BR: save(budget)
BS-&gt;&gt;&gt;TR: query(month filter)
TR.&gt;BS: transactions
BS-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS +1: build BudgetStatus
BS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AM: evaluate(status)
combinedFragment=loop~cf3 User L; User:                 [each category at 80 percent or more of its limit]
AM-&gt;&gt;&gt;AM +1: create Alert (WARNING or OVER)
AM-&gt;&gt;&gt;L: onAlert(alert)
L.&gt;User: toast in GUI or line in CLI
--=cf3
BS.&gt;F: BudgetStatus
F.&gt;DV: BudgetStatus
DV.&gt;User: progress bars updated
--=cf2</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element></diagram>